{"unit_id": "EamonnLiu__dsh-openrouter-guardrails#card-zh", "repo": "EamonnLiu/dsh-openrouter-guardrails", "commit": "6a86c33ae5e6ac8eae89ef2b49bbc62903c16c91", "type": "card", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-openrouter-guardrails 是一个适用于 DSH Web、桌面和 CLI 配置的模型路由插件。它读取 OpenRouter 路由的凭据，定期查询该密钥可使用的模型，并通过 DSH settings 更新模型列表；已在本地模型目录中的模型保留目录信息，目录尚未收录的模型会放入单独路由。同步会在启动、凭据变更和定时间隔触发，也会记录同步状态。适合需要让模型选择器反映 OpenRouter 密钥权限的用户。使用前需配置 OpenRouter 账户、路由和凭据。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:26-40", "lib/sync.js:118-142", "lib/models.js:138-180"]}
{"unit_id": "EamonnLiu__dsh-openrouter-guardrails#card-en", "repo": "EamonnLiu/dsh-openrouter-guardrails", "commit": "6a86c33ae5e6ac8eae89ef2b49bbc62903c16c91", "type": "card", "lang": "en", "text": "dsh-openrouter-guardrails filters DSH OpenRouter model lists to models allowed by the configured key. It syncs at startup, after credential changes, and periodically. Catalogued models stay on the original route; others use a separate route. Requires an OpenRouter account and credential.", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:26-40", "lib/sync.js:118-142", "lib/models.js:138-180"]}
