{"unit_id": "EamonnLiu__dsh-openrouter-guardrails#feature-1", "repo": "EamonnLiu/dsh-openrouter-guardrails", "commit": "6a86c33ae5e6ac8eae89ef2b49bbc62903c16c91", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-openrouter-guardrails 的功能「按密钥同步模型」：启动时、OpenRouter 路由凭据更新后及定时触发同步；查询该凭据可用模型，并将已收录模型写入原路由的模型列表。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:74-117", "lib/sync.js:118-142", "lib/sync.js:191-220"]}
{"unit_id": "EamonnLiu__dsh-openrouter-guardrails#feature-2", "repo": "EamonnLiu/dsh-openrouter-guardrails", "commit": "6a86c33ae5e6ac8eae89ef2b49bbc62903c16c91", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-openrouter-guardrails 的功能「补充目录外模型」：同步时把本地目录未描述但可服务的模型转换为模型条目，放入单独的 OpenRouter 兼容路由；不再需要时移除该路由。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/models.js:102-136", "lib/sync.js:160-190"]}
{"unit_id": "EamonnLiu__dsh-openrouter-guardrails#caveat-1", "repo": "EamonnLiu/dsh-openrouter-guardrails", "commit": "6a86c33ae5e6ac8eae89ef2b49bbc62903c16c91", "type": "caveat", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-openrouter-guardrails 使用前须知：插件会把配置路由的 API 凭据作为 Bearer 凭据发送到该路由的 baseURL，查询 /models/user；默认服务为 openrouter.ai。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/sync.js:121-142", "lib/openrouter.js:14-15", "lib/openrouter.js:60-78"]}
